OL,3,AGlastonbury coach tickets oversold in
OL,4,Aadmin error
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn administrative error resulted in
OL,7,Fcoach journeys to the Glastonbury
OL,8,FFestival being oversold through its
OL,9,Fofficial ticketing partner.
OL,11,FMore coach package tickets were sold
OL,12,Ffor certain departures than there are
OL,13,Fseats available, according to an email
OL,14,FSee Tickets sent to customers.
OL,16,FThose affected will not lose their
OL,17,Ftickets however. Instead, their booking
OL,18,Fwill automatically be converted into a
OL,19,Fgeneral admission ticket and the coach
OL,20,Ffare will be refunded.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
