OL,3,AGlastonbury coach tickets oversold in
OL,4,Aadmin error
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ticketing agency declined to
OL,7,Fcomment further, but the BBC
OL,8,Funderstands Glastonbury Festival was
OL,9,Fnot responsible for the error.
